Third-party notices
===================

provisa/profiler/reference/*.txt.gz
-----------------------------------
The reference lists the profiler's classification kinds test column values against (countries,
country codes, currency codes, language codes and cities) are derived from the GeoNames
geographical database (https://www.geonames.org/), files countryInfo.txt, iso-languagecodes.txt
and cities15000.txt of https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/, used under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes: the values were normalised (trimmed, case-folded, inner spaces collapsed), reduced to the
columns named in scripts/build_classification_reference.py, sorted and deduplicated.
